{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forget epic quests and dragon-slaying \u2014 this is war for the vibes.</strong><br>The <i>Sesh-On Demo</i> drops you into one bespoke sesh where <strong>Barry Fuel</strong> and <strong>Linda Schnoz</strong> team up to escape the crushing boredom of office life. Together, they\u2019ll battle across grid-based party zones, slinging booze, pies, and terrible ideas at the nerds draining the vibe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>What\u2019s in the Demo?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Legendary Sesh</strong><br>Join Barry and Linda\u2019s desperate attempt to outdrink, outthink, and outright humiliate vibe-killing nerds from the office and beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-Based Tactics, Party Style</strong><br>Every move matters \u2014 deploy drinks, drugs, and dumb fun with surgical precision to keep the sesh alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Vibe Is Everything</strong><br>Boost it with chaos, wreck it with mistakes, and protect it at all costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Why Try the Demo?</strong><br>If you love the tactical depth of <i>Into the Breach</i> but wish it came with cheap lager, cream pies to the face, and decisions that look much smarter at 4am, this demo is your perfect taster of the glorious disaster to come.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4063720?t=1759648756","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4063720?t=1759648756","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063720/30f3b96a6df3a4bf123a7849314e42d8b4987a41/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759648756","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063720/30f3b96a6df3a4bf123a7849314e42d8b4987a41/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=17596487